Chapter: Esp32C6Drivers

  cites Boards chapter Esp32C6Board

 Smoke test for ESP32-C6 board drivers. MMIO stubs return 0 on the
 hosted VM, so this exercises the driver logic and bit manipulation
 without real hardware. All fuel-bounded loops terminate immediately
 since the status registers read as 0.

 The driver functions declare [Device.Mmio], so this test declares it
 too. It cannot not: a test chapter is not on the effect-exemption list,
 which means the row the drivers carry is checked right here, at the
 first caller outside the quire. Each test returns 1 when its driver
 calls all complete; the six sum to the expected 6.

Section: Definitions

  test-gpio : [Device.Mmio] Integer
  test-gpio = act
    a <- esp32c6-gpio-set-output 8
    b <- esp32c6-gpio-set 8
    c <- esp32c6-gpio-clear 8
    d <- esp32c6-gpio-set-input 4
    e <- esp32c6-gpio-read 4
    f <- esp32c6-gpio-toggle 8
    g <- (esp32c6-gpio-set-pull 4 1)
    1
  end

  test-led : [Device.Mmio] Integer
  test-led = act
    a <- esp32c6-led-init
    b <- esp32c6-led-on
    c <- esp32c6-led-off
    1
  end

  test-uart : [Device.Mmio] Integer
  test-uart = act
    a <- esp32c6-uart-init 115200
    b <- esp32c6-uart-send-byte esp32c6-uart0-base 65
    c <- esp32c6-uart-print esp32c6-uart0-base "hello"
    d <- (esp32c6-uart-println esp32c6-uart0-base "world")
    1
  end

  test-spi : [Device.Mmio] Integer
  test-spi = act
    a <- esp32c6-spi-init
    b <- (esp32c6-spi-transfer esp32c6-spi2-base #AA)
    1
  end

  test-i2c : [Device.Mmio] Integer
  test-i2c = act
    a <- esp32c6-i2c-init
    b <- esp32c6-i2c-write-reg #68 #6B 0
    c <- (esp32c6-i2c-read-reg #68 #75)
    1
  end

 The delay is pure -- it spins on the CPU and touches nothing -- so it
 is bound with a plain let, not an act-bind. If someone gives it a
 register access later, this line stops compiling.

  test-delay : Integer
  test-delay =
    let a = esp32c6-delay-ms 1
    in 1

  opening : [Device.Mmio] Integer = act
    g <- test-gpio
    l <- test-led
    u <- test-uart
    s <- test-spi
    i <- test-i2c
    g + l + u + s + i + test-delay
  end

